    "M0Rf-M0R0 data+.5375831919 MCSE.0388933955, but MfRf-MfR0+.0176694578 MCSE.0187571550 is unresolved. Interaction-.5199137341 MCSE.0319559888 is large and negative. A separable single-head cause is unsupported.",
    "Pure Af mean canonicalQ drops4.5758684206 to4.0774852555 Vns and mean carrierRMS.0336197491 to.0276050420 V; peak.1783316648 to.1257637038 V. Af-only and MfR0 have zero boundary/global-outside/rail flags in all3H despite much worse wave energy. The deterministic-output deterioration cannot be entirely attributed to the flagged crop-search failures.",
