    "With learned Rf, mean charge log variance rises.0912635733 under M0 to.4222713433 under Mf and local-envelope globalRMS.0002246263 to.0056577503 V; functional M/R coupling is present. This does not identify the training-history cause or imply the coupling must be removed.",
